# `row[j] += a * b`: the contents of row are proven numbers. Its read was held boxed, since the sum's other operand is still to come when the read is built and only a read out of a list of numbers counted
# as bringing no text. What an operator that makes numbers makes is no text either: the read is held as a number or nothing, and the sum takes it as it is.
# Beside a value that may be a text the read stays boxed.
